<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PF 09.006 Modern Hope Replica</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">L=26.7 mm    W=23.2 mm  actual size.  For a smooth</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">girdle "freewheel" the stone a a lap so that the sharp</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">facet intersections are blunted.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">58 facets + 40 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
